WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.659
Oliver Byrne's Euclid

00:00:01.694 --> 00:00:03.616
The 1847 Geometry

00:00:03.428 --> 00:00:04.394
Book Printed in

00:00:04.206 --> 00:00:04.831
Color

00:00:05.358 --> 00:00:07.421
Oliver Byrne's 1847

00:00:07.233 --> 00:00:08.376
edition of Euclid's

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:09.473
Elements printed its

00:00:09.285 --> 00:00:10.947
geometric proofs as

00:00:10.759 --> 00:00:11.973
bold diagrams in

00:00:11.785 --> 00:00:12.291
red

00:00:12.457 --> 00:00:13.600
yellow and blue

00:00:13.424 --> 00:00:14.461
instead of dense

00:00:14.273 --> 00:00:14.874
text

00:00:15.075 --> 00:00:15.570
one of the

00:00:15.382 --> 00:00:17.032
most striking mathematics

00:00:16.844 --> 00:00:18.353
books ever published

00:00:18.886 --> 00:00:20.124
Open any edition

00:00:19.936 --> 00:00:20.961
of Euclid printed

00:00:20.773 --> 00:00:23.756
between 1482 and 1846

00:00:23.921 --> 00:00:24.475
and you meet

00:00:24.287 --> 00:00:25.442
the same sentence

00:00:25.561 --> 00:00:26.586
thousands of times

00:00:26.398 --> 00:00:26.952
over

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:29.392
Around 1873 the

00:00:29.203 --> 00:00:30.182
couple settled in

00:00:29.994 --> 00:00:30.783
her home town

00:00:30.595 --> 00:00:31.444
of Maidstone in

00:00:31.255 --> 00:00:31.809
Kent

00:00:31.939 --> 00:00:32.682
and there Byrne

00:00:32.494 --> 00:00:33.625
died of pneumonia

00:00:33.437 --> 00:00:35.618
on 9 December 1880

00:00:35.748 --> 00:00:36.715
aged seventy

00:00:37.254 --> 00:00:38.268
Full story on

00:00:38.079 --> 00:00:38.975
the dashboard
